From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Alexbob0 <alextsmail@pm.me>
Date: Wed, 4 Nov 2026 09:04:44 +0100
Subject: Closed tools per turn: model_options.closed_tools refused by the
 dispatcher

A turn's model_options may name tools that turn must not run (closed_tools, exact names or a prefix ending in *):
the dispatcher refuses them, tool_call's underlying tool included, with a reply saying what to do instead. The
request still offers every tool (the prompt cache's prefix stays the conversations'), and everything else is the
person's usual turn. Set again at every turn (the direct path's _create_agent, the TurnRunner's resolved agent), so a
cached agent's next turn runs them again. BipAgents closes the media and long tools in a voice call's turns.

BipAgents patch, documented in hermes/patches/README.md of the BipAgents repository.

Bip-Patch: 0024-closed-tools-per-turn
